# Rikfiri Business Website Specification

## 1. Concept & Vision

Rikfiri is a premium transportation and logistics company based in the UAE. The website embodies **trust, professionalism, and reliability** — the three pillars that define the brand. The design language communicates confidence and competence while remaining approachable and customer-focused. Every element guides visitors toward one goal: **contacting us**.

## 2. Design Language

### Aesthetic Direction
**Corporate Premium** — Clean lines, generous whitespace, bold typography, and subtle sophistication. Inspired by luxury automotive brands and high-end service companies.

### Color Palette
- **Primary (Dark Navy):** `#0F172A` — Headers, primary buttons, footer
- **Secondary (Royal Blue):** `#1E40AF` — Accents, links, highlights
- **Accent (Gold):** `#D4AF37` — CTAs, important elements, premium touches
- **Background Light:** `#F8FAFC` — Section backgrounds
- **Background White:** `#FFFFFF` — Cards, main content areas
- **Text Primary:** `#1E293B` — Headings, body text
- **Text Secondary:** `#64748B` — Descriptions, captions
- **Success Green:** `#10B981` — WhatsApp button

### Typography
- **Headings:** Inter (Arabic: Noto Sans Arabic) — Bold weights, tight tracking
- **Body:** Inter (Arabic: Noto Sans Arabic) — Regular/Medium weights
- **Fallbacks:** system-ui, sans-serif

### Spatial System
- Base unit: 4px
- Section padding: 80px vertical (desktop), 48px (mobile)
- Card padding: 24px
- Component gaps: 16px, 24px, 32px
- Max content width: 1200px

### Motion Philosophy
- **Micro-interactions:** Subtle scale (1.02) on card hover, 200ms ease-out
- **Scroll animations:** Fade-up on intersection, 400ms ease-out, staggered 100ms
- **Button hover:** Background shift + subtle lift (translateY -2px)
- **Page transitions:** Smooth scroll behavior

### Visual Assets
- **Icons:** Lucide React icons — consistent stroke width, clean lines
- **Images:** Professional transportation/logistics imagery via Unsplash
- **Decorative:** Subtle gradient overlays, geometric accent shapes

## 3. Layout & Structure

### Page Structure
Single-page application with smooth scroll navigation:
1. **Navigation** — Fixed top, transparent → solid on scroll
2. **Hero** — Full viewport, bold headline, dual CTA buttons
3. **About** — Split layout with image and company story
4. **Services** — 6-card grid showcasing offerings
5. **Why Choose Us** — 4-column trust indicators
6. **Gallery** — Masonry/grid showcase of work
7. **Contact** — Form + contact info side-by-side
8. **Footer** — Links, social, copyright

### RTL Support
- Full bidirectional support
- Arabic content with `dir="rtl"` on Arabic sections
- Mirrored layouts for Arabic
- Font switching automatically

### Responsive Strategy
- Mobile-first approach
- Breakpoints: 640px (sm), 768px (md), 1024px (lg), 1280px (xl)
- Stack layouts on mobile, grid on desktop
- Touch-friendly tap targets (min 44px)

## 4. Features & Interactions

### Navigation
- Sticky header with logo + nav links
- Language toggle (AR/EN) — switches entire site language
- Mobile hamburger menu with slide-in drawer
- Active section highlighting on scroll

### Hero Section
- Full-screen background with overlay
- Animated headline with typewriter or fade-in effect
- Two prominent CTAs: "Call Now" (gold) + "WhatsApp" (green)
- Scroll indicator arrow

### Contact Form
- Fields: Name (required), Phone (required), Service dropdown, Message
- Real-time validation with error messages
- Success state with confirmation message
- Form data logged to console (lead capture ready)

### Floating Action Buttons
- WhatsApp button: Fixed bottom-right, pulse animation
- Phone button: Secondary floating button
- Both open native actions (tel:, wa.me)

### Service Cards
- Icon + title + short description
- Hover: lift + shadow increase
- Click: smooth scroll to contact section

### Gallery
- 6-image grid (3x2 desktop, 2x3 tablet, 1x6 mobile)
- Lightbox on click
- Smooth zoom-in animation

## 5. Component Inventory

### NavBar
- States: transparent (top), solid (scrolled), mobile-open
- Logo, nav links, language toggle, mobile menu button
- Sticky positioning with backdrop blur

### HeroSection
- Background image with gradient overlay
- Headline (H1), subheadline, dual CTAs
- Animated entrance on load

### ServiceCard
- Icon container, title, description
- States: default, hover (elevated + shadow)
- Click handler for scroll-to-contact

### TrustBadge
- Icon, number/stat, label
- Used in "Why Choose Us" section
- Subtle animation on scroll-into-view

### ContactForm
- Input fields with floating labels
- States: empty, focused, filled, error, success
- Submit button with loading state

### WhatsAppButton
- Fixed position, rounded, brand green
- Icon + optional label
- Pulse animation
- Opens wa.me link

### GalleryItem
- Image container with aspect ratio
- Hover: slight zoom + overlay with icon
- Click: opens lightbox

### Footer
- Logo, quick links, contact info, social icons
- Copyright notice
- Dark background

## 6. Technical Approach

### Stack
- **Framework:** React 18 + TypeScript
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS 3.4
- **Icons:** Lucide React
- **Routing:** React Router v6 (for potential multi-page)
- **Build:** Vite 6.0

### Key Implementation Details
- Language context for AR/EN switching
- Intersection Observer for scroll animations
- Form state management with React hooks
- CSS custom properties for theming
- Semantic HTML for SEO

### SEO
- Meta tags: title, description, keywords
- Open Graph tags for social sharing
- Semantic heading hierarchy (single H1)
- Alt text on all images
- Structured data ready

### Performance
- Lazy loading for images
- Code splitting by route
- Optimized asset delivery
- Lighthouse score target: 90+
